From 86b158e008c8a1ea688608a179e1ff6d81c05ea8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@example.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:38:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add global voice input (offline Whisper), PWA install button,
 Docker/CI

- Global voice dictation on every text field; inserts at caret, never overwrites
- Engines: on-device Whisper (default, offline), browser speech, optional server
- Install button captured early (fixes missed beforeinstallprompt); landing/header/settings
- Fix 48x48 maskable icon declared as 512x512
- Multi-stage Dockerfile, compose, CI template, cache headers, CSP for wasm/models
- Optional /api/transcribe proxy; tests (40)
